  "description": "Spaceborne spectrometers for measuring electromagnetic spectra across UV, visible, IR, and X-ray bands. Includes imaging spectrometers (NIRSpec, MIRI on JWST), grating and prism dispersive elements, Fourier-transform spectrometers, and cryogenic detector arrays (H2RG, MCT). Enables composition analysis of atmospheres, surfaces, and distant astronomical objects.",
